{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hollow Floor is an atmospheric psychological horror  set in a looping, scorched apartment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in a scorched apartment, you attempt to escape the unending hallways. However, you quickly discover there is no escape, and you aren't the only one trapped here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore looping halls:</strong>\u00a0Each loop reveals more of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro graphics:</strong> Low-Poly Pixelated graphics evoke the feelings of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tense sound design:</strong> Atmospheric soundscapes keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surreal psychological horror:</strong> Dreamlike unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average play time:</strong> 30-60 minutes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847090?t=1751791948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847090?t=1751791948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847090/10d429a0b536ed99e719c4f5002852d43277e9dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751791948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847090/10d429a0b536ed99e719c4f5002852d43277e9dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751791948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of violence and gore as well as alcohol and drug use."},"demos":[{"appid":3853580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hollow Floor is an atmospheric psychological horror  set in a looping, scorched apartment.\u00a